Subject: Native compiler closure for whole original HBM player/heap owners

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Use actual owning declarations, standard placement new, qualified original
outer-handle friendships, the existing reverse-iterator operation and full
native pointer arithmetic. Lower the original signed32 MWCC abs intrinsic
at the whole MEM frame-heap TU. Preserve original console declarations and
all original algorithms, branches, requests, callbacks and ordering.

This does not supply missing SeqPlayer or MEM state methods and does not
admit HBM creation, a full player or successful resource readiness.

